    <string name="ota_about_app_description">BMenetrend is an open, modern public transit schedule and live vehicle tracker. Track MÁV rail trains, HÉV, Volánbusz, BKK lines (bus, tram, trolley, metro), as well as local ViaBusz, KanyarGO and HOMM departures and vehicle locations in real time.</string>
